  "summary": "The paper introduces QuantCut, an automatic circuit-cutting framework, and demonstrates it on QAOA for portfolio diversification using a 71‑qubit Max‑Cut formulation derived from S&P 500 data. A toy 10‑qubit noisy simulation shows improved convergence behavior with circuit cutting, while the 71‑qubit experiment (p=1 with three gate cuts per layer) achieves Max‑Cut 43.41 but is outperformed by a classical evolutionary algorithm (46.51).",
